00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:04.160
So, although you exist, you no longer exist in time, and for you, time itself does not exist.

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:07.980
You see, although you're still a mass, you are no longer an event in space-time,

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.340
